#: ../../005_mcp.md:1
msgid "Using FCS with AI Agents (MCP)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:3
msgid ""
"Starting with FCS 26.10, FCS can provide a local Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP) server. An MCP-compatible AI agent can inspect the current FCS "
"session, operate supported workflows, and read the bundled FCS operating "
"guide. AI agents can directly help you the time consuming part of your "
"tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:6
msgid "Before You Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:8
msgid "You need:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:10
msgid ""
"FCS 26.10 or later with a valid license, running on the same computer as "
"the AI agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:11
msgid "An MCP client that supports Streamable HTTP servers on the local computer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:13
msgid ""
"FCS must remain open and licensed while the agent is working on it. The "
"MCP server listens only on `127.0.0.1`, so it is not available to other "
"computers or to cloud-only agents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:15
msgid "Enable the MCP Server"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:17
msgid ""
"Launch FCS normally. The procedure is the same for the installed FCS "
"executable and for a Python/script launch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:19
msgid "Open **Settings** and expand **MCP Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:20
msgid "Enable **Enable MCP Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:21
msgid ""
"Keep the default port, `19877`, unless it conflicts with another local "
"program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:23
msgid "Save the settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:24
msgid ""
"Confirm that the status displays **Listening at "
"[http://127.0.0.1:19877/mcp](http://127.0.0.1:19877/mcp)**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:27
msgid ""
"Use the complete URL shown by FCS when configuring a client. If you "
"change the port, use the updated URL in every client configuration. Port "
"`19876` is reserved by FCS and cannot be used for MCP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:31
msgid "Connect an AI Agent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:33
msgid ""
"The setup is performed once for each agent. Name the server `fcs` or "
"`FCS` and use the URL displayed in FCS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:36
msgid "ChatGPT Desktop and the Codex App"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:38
msgid "Open **Settings > Plugins > MCP**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:39
msgid "Select **Add server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:40
msgid "Enter `FCS` as the name and select **Streamable HTTP**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:41
msgid "Enter `http://127.0.0.1:19877/mcp` as the URL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:42
msgid "Save the server and restart the app when prompted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:44
msgid ""
"This applies to local ChatGPT/Codex clients that support custom MCP "
"servers. ChatGPT in a web browser cannot connect directly to the FCS "
"loopback address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:47
msgid "Codex CLI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:49 ../../005_mcp.md:60
msgid "Run:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:55
msgid ""
"Use `codex mcp list` to check the connection. Inside Codex, use `/mcp` to"
" view the connected server and its tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:58
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:66
msgid ""
"The user scope makes FCS available in future Claude Code sessions on this"
" computer. Run `claude mcp list` to check the connection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:69
msgid "Visual Studio Code and GitHub Copilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:71
msgid "Open the Command Palette with **Ctrl+Shift+P**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:72
msgid "Run **MCP: Add Server**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:73
msgid "Select **HTTP**, enter the FCS URL, and name the server `FCS`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:74
msgid ""
"Choose the global/user profile location so that the connection is "
"available outside one workspace."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:76
msgid ""
"Open Chat and use **Configure Tools** to confirm that the FCS tools are "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:81
msgid "OpenCode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:83
msgid "Add a remote MCP server to the OpenCode configuration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:100
msgid ""
"FCS does not require OAuth because the endpoint is restricted to the "
"local computer. Check the MCP server list in OpenCode after saving the "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:103
msgid "Claude Desktop"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:105
msgid ""
"Claude Desktop custom connectors are intended for remotely reachable "
"servers and cannot be assumed to reach FCS at `127.0.0.1`. FCS currently "
"does not ship the separate stdio bridge required by Claude Desktop's "
"traditional local MCP configuration. Use Claude Code or another local "
"Streamable HTTP client instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:111
msgid "Available Workflows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:113
msgid "The public MCP tools cover these areas:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:115
msgid ""
"Application and session status, session creation, opening, inspection, "
"and saving."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:117
msgid "Video import, library and sequence browsing, and video selection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:118
msgid "Single and batch processing, job progress, status, and cancellation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:119
msgid "Export validation, export defaults, and session export."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:120
msgid "Renderer status, connection testing, launch, and scene opening."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:121
msgid "Processing profiles and settings inspection or updates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:122
msgid ""
"ROM gallery queries, updates, prediction, deletion, and timeline "
"navigation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:123
msgid ""
"Controller inspection, editing, presets, reordering, synchronization, and"
" explicit saving."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:126
msgid ""
"FCS intentionally exposes a curated set of named tools. License "
"management and internal application commands are not available through "
"MCP. The exact tool list is discovered automatically by the client when "
"it connects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:130
msgid "Example conversations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:132
msgid ""
"After connecting, speak to the agent normally. You do not need to "
"memorize MCP tool names. The agent can also read the FCS operating guide "
"exposed through MCP before acting. Representative exchanges:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:141 ../../005_mcp.md:309 ../../005_mcp.md:339
msgid "**User**"
msgstr "**User**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:143
msgid ""
"添付した作業リストと `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture` 内のデータから、FCS の MCP を用いて "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions` に作業に必要なセッションをすべて作成し、 "
"動画のインポートも実行してください。"
msgstr ""
"Using this work list and the data under `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture`,"
" create all sessions needed for the work in "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions` via the FCS MCP, and import the"
" videos as well."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:150 ../../005_mcp.md:317 ../../005_mcp.md:346
msgid "**Agent**"
msgstr "**Agent**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:152
msgid ""
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions` は存在するが空です。作業リストと照らし合わせると、 "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets/scenes` には `Hero_001` と "
"`Extra_001`、`Side_001` のシーンしかなく、作業リスト上の `Side_A`、`Side_B`、`Extra_A` "
"用のシーンがありません。 いくつか確認させてください。"
msgstr ""
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions` exists but is empty. Compared "
"with the work list, `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets/scenes` only "
"has scenes for `Hero_001`, `Extra_001`, and `Side_001`, and there are no "
"scenes for `Side_A`, `Side_B`, or `Extra_A` on the work list. Please let "
"me confirm a few things."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:159
msgid "**1. セッションはどのように作成しますか？（1つ選択）**"
msgstr "**1. How should the sessions be created? (Select one)**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:165
msgid ""
"**アクター別セッション（推奨）** — "
"Alice→`Hero_001`、Bob→`Side_A`+`Side_B`、Carol→`Extra_A` "
"の計4セッション。存在しないシーンは後で差し替え"
msgstr ""
"**Sessions by actor (Recommended)** — 4 sessions total: "
"Alice→`Hero_001`, Bob→`Side_A`+`Side_B`, Carol→`Extra_A`. Replace missing"
" scenes later"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:171
msgid ""
"**3セッション（actor=performer）** — Alice/Bob/Carol の各アクターにキャラは先行文字（`Hero_001` "
"等）を指定"
msgstr ""
"**3 sessions (actor=performer)** — For each of Alice/Bob/Carol, assign "
"a leading character ID (e.g. `Hero_001`)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:177
msgid "`Hero_001` **のみ** — Alice→`Hero_001` のみ作成し動画もそれだけインポート"
msgstr ""
"**`Hero_001` only** — Create only Alice→`Hero_001` and import only that"
" video"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:183 ../../005_mcp.md:273
msgid "**自分の回答を入力** — 自由記入"
msgstr "**Enter your own answer** — Free text"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:189
msgid "**2. シーンが存在しないキャラ（`Side_A`、`Side_B`、`Extra_A`）のセッションはどのシーンを指定しますか？（1つ選択）**"
msgstr ""
"**2. Which scene should be used for sessions of characters without scenes"
" (`Side_A`, `Side_B`, `Extra_A`)? (Select one)**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:195
msgid ""
"`Hero_001` **のシーンで代用（推奨）** — 試験環境なので `Hero_001` のシーンを流用し、`maya_base` は "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets` を指定"
msgstr ""
"**Substitute with the `Hero_001` scene (Recommended)** — Reuse the "
"`Hero_001` scene for this test setup, and set `maya_base` to "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:201
msgid "`Extra_001` **シーンを指定** — `Extra_001_setup_FacialBase.ma` を指定"
msgstr "**Specify the `Extra_001` scene** — Use `Extra_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:207
msgid "**シーンを指定する** — 自分でシーンと `maya_base` を指定する"
msgstr "**Specify a scene** — Specify the scene and `maya_base` yourself"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:213
msgid ""
"**自分の回答を入力** — `Side_A` と `Side_B` は `Side_001` に、`Extra_A` は `Extra_001`"
" にまとめて進めて"
msgstr ""
"**Enter your own answer** — Group `Side_A` and `Side_B` as `Side_001`, "
"and proceed with `Extra_A` as `Extra_001`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:219
msgid "**3. Maya バージョンは何を指定しますか？（1つ選択）**"
msgstr "**3. Which Maya version should be specified? (Select one)**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:225
msgid "**2023（推奨）** — 既存セッションと同じ設定"
msgstr "**2023 (Recommended)** — Same setting as the existing session"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:231
msgid "**2022** — 2022 を指定"
msgstr "**2022** — Specify 2022"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:237
msgid "**2024** — 2024 を指定"
msgstr "**2024** — Specify 2024"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:243
msgid "**自分の回答を入力** — 対応する Maya シーンから読み取って"
msgstr "**Enter your own answer** — Read it from the corresponding Maya scene"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:249
msgid "**4. インポートする動画はどのセットですか？（1つ選択）**"
msgstr "**4. Which set of videos should be imported? (Select one)**"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:255
msgid ""
"`01_HMC` + `04_ROM` **（推奨）** — `01_HMC\\01_Alice`、`02_Bob`、`03_Carol` の動画"
" + `04_ROM` の ROM 動画を各セッションへ。`02_Reference` / `03_4view` は除外"
msgstr ""
"**`01_HMC` + `04_ROM` (Recommended)** — Import videos under "
"`01_HMC\\01_Alice`, `02_Bob`, `03_Carol` plus ROM videos from `04_ROM` "
"into each session. Exclude `02_Reference` / `03_4view`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:261
msgid "`01_HMC` **のみ** — `01_Alice` / `Bob` / `Carol` フォルダの mp4 のみ各セッションへ"
msgstr ""
"**`01_HMC` only** — Only mp4 files from the `01_Alice` / `Bob` / "
"`Carol` folders into each session"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:267
msgid ""
"**すべて（Reference 含む）** — 01～04 の全 mp4（`02_Reference`、`03_4view_Ref` "
"も含む）を該当セッションへインポート"
msgstr ""
"**All (including Reference)** — Import all mp4 files from 01–04 "
"(including `02_Reference` and `03_4view_Ref`) into the matching sessions"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:279
msgid "完了しました。3つの FCS セッションを作成し、対応動画と ROM をインポート済みです。"
msgstr ""
"Done. Created 3 FCS sessions and imported the corresponding videos and "
"ROMs."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:288
msgid "Actor / Character"
msgstr "Actor / Character"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:289
msgid "Maya scene"
msgstr "Maya scene"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:290
msgid "インポート動画"
msgstr "Imported videos"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:291
msgid "Alice / Hero_001"
msgstr "Alice / Hero_001"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:292
msgid "`Hero_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"
msgstr "`Hero_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:293
msgid "19本 + ROM 1本"
msgstr "19 videos + 1 ROM"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:294
msgid "Bob / Side_001"
msgstr "Bob / Side_001"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:295
msgid "`Side_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"
msgstr "`Side_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:296
msgid "16本 + ROM 1本"
msgstr "16 videos + 1 ROM"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:297
msgid "Carol / Extra_001"
msgstr "Carol / Extra_001"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:298
msgid "`Extra_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"
msgstr "`Extra_001_setup_FacialBase.ma`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:299
msgid "13本 + ROM 1本"
msgstr "13 videos + 1 ROM"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:302
msgid ""
"シーンは `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets`、Maya 2025 で作成しました。 作成先は "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions/FCS/` です。 現在は `Bob / Side_001` "
"セッションを開いた状態です。"
msgstr ""
"Scenes are under `D:/FacialCapture/SampleCapture/Assets`, created with "
"Maya 2025. Output is under "
"`D:/FacialCapture/SampleProject/Sessions/FCS/`. The `Bob / Side_001` "
"session is currently open."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:311
msgid ""
"`Alice / Hero_001` のセッションに切り替えて、Mayaを開いたりシーンを解析したりして、コントローラの登録を行ってほしい。 "
"適切な region と min/max/default も含めて登録して。"
msgstr ""
"Switch to the `Alice / Hero_001` session, open Maya or analyze the scene,"
" and register controllers. Register suitable controllers including region"
" and min/max/default."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:319
msgid "完了しました。"
msgstr "Done."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:321
msgid "**実施内容 (**`Alice / Hero_001` **セッション)**:"
msgstr "**What was done (**`Alice / Hero_001` **session)**:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:323
msgid "**セッション切替** — `Alice / Hero_001` を開きました（動画20本、controller_count 0 からスタート）"
msgstr ""
"**Session switch** — Opened `Alice / Hero_001` (20 videos, starting from "
"controller_count 0)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:324
msgid ""
"**Maya シーンからパース** — `Hero_001_setup_FacialBase.ma` から `CTRL_`* ノードを抽出し、 "
"Metahuman プリセットの命名（例: `CTRL_L_brow_down.ty`）と一致することを確認"
msgstr ""
"**Parsed the Maya scene** — Extracted `CTRL_*` nodes from "
"`Hero_001_setup_FacialBase.ma` and confirmed they match the Metahuman "
"preset naming (e.g. `CTRL_L_brow_down.ty`)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:326
msgid "**登録・保存** — Metahuman プリセット経由で 174 コントローラをリージョン付きで登録し保存"
msgstr ""
"**Registered and saved** — Registered 174 controllers with regions via "
"the Metahuman preset and saved"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:328
msgid "**登録結果**:"
msgstr "**Registration result**:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:330
msgid "upper: 28行（眉・鼻・首など）"
msgstr "upper: 28 rows (brows, nose, neck, etc.)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:331
msgid "eyelid: 18行（瞬き・まぶたなど）"
msgstr "eyelid: 18 rows (blink, eyelids, etc.)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:332
msgid "gaze: 5行"
msgstr "gaze: 5 rows"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:333
msgid "lower: 123行（口・舌・顎・歯）"
msgstr "lower: 123 rows (mouth, tongue, jaw, teeth)"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:334
msgid "合計 **174行** — すべて min=0.0 / max=1.0 / default=0.0 で保存済み"
msgstr "Total **174 rows** — all saved with min=0.0 / max=1.0 / default=0.0"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:341
msgid "一部のコントローラは min が -1 だったと思う。確認して修正してほしい。"
msgstr "I think some controllers should have min=-1. Please check and fix them."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:348
msgid "確認・修正完了です。"
msgstr "Checked and fixed."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:350
msgid "**調査結果** — Mayaシーン内の各CTRLノードをcommadPortで解析し、各チャンネルの接続先を判定しました:"
msgstr ""
"**Findings** — Analyzed each CTRL node in the Maya scene via commandPort "
"and determined channel destinations:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:352
msgid "双方向に動くチャンネル（`tx`、または Up/Down のような逆向きペアに接続される `ty`）はレンジ -1..1 が正しい"
msgstr ""
"Bidirectional channels (`tx`, or `ty` connected to opposite pairs such as"
" Up/Down) should use the -1..1 range"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:353
msgid "単一の表情（例: `brow_down` → `browDownL`）に繋がる `ty` は 0..1 のまま"
msgstr ""
"`ty` channels that drive a single expression (e.g. `brow_down` → "
"`browDownL`) stay at 0..1"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:355
msgid "**修正内容** — 双方向駆動の 77 コントローラの `min_value` を `-1.0` に更新して保存しました:"
msgstr ""
"**Changes** — Updated `min_value` to `-1.0` for 77 bidirectional "
"controllers and saved:"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:357
msgid "upper: nose、neck 系など"
msgstr "upper: nose, neck, etc."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:358
msgid "eyelid: blink、eyelid 系など"
msgstr "eyelid: blink, eyelid, etc."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:359
msgid "gaze: `CTRL_L/R_eye.tx/.ty`"
msgstr "gaze: `CTRL_L/R_eye.tx/.ty`"

#: ../../005_mcp.md:360
msgid "lower: mouth、lips、jaw、teeth、tongue 系など"
msgstr "lower: mouth, lips, jaw, teeth, tongue, etc."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:362
msgid ""
"**検証済み** — `ControllerInfo.yaml`に min_value: "
"-1.0が77行反映、全174行の登録が維持されています。シングル方向のコントローラ（`brow_down`、`jawOpen` など）は適切に "
"0..1 のままです。"
msgstr ""
"**Verified** — `ControllerInfo.yaml` now has min_value: -1.0 on 77 rows, "
"and all 174 registered controllers remain. Unidirectional controllers "
"(`brow_down`, `jawOpen`, etc.) correctly stay at 0..1."

#: ../../005_mcp.md:366
msgid "Review Actions Before Approval"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:368
msgid ""
"Your MCP client may request approval before a tool runs. Read the "
"proposed action carefully, particularly before allowing an agent to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:371
msgid "Delete ROMs or cancel processing jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:372
msgid "Change and save application settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:373
msgid "Save a session or controller table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:374
msgid "Start processing or export files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:376
msgid ""
"Prefer asking the agent to inspect or validate first, summarize the "
"planned changes, and perform the mutation only after you approve it. "
"Controller edits remain a working draft until the agent explicitly saves "
"them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:380
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:384
msgid "FCS shows Disabled"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:386
msgid ""
"Enable **MCP Server** in Settings and save. Merely changing the checkbox "
"without saving does not apply the setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:389
msgid "FCS shows Waiting for a valid license"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:391
msgid ""
"Complete FCS license activation. The endpoint starts only while the "
"license is valid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:394
msgid "FCS shows an error or the port is already in use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:396
msgid ""
"Choose another port from `1024` through `65535`, except `19876`, save the"
" settings, and update the URL in the AI agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:399
msgid "The agent cannot connect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:401
msgid ""
"Confirm that FCS is still open, its status says **Listening**, and the "
"client URL exactly matches the status URL, including `/mcp`. A client "
"running on another computer, in a remote development environment, or only"
" in the cloud cannot reach the FCS `127.0.0.1` endpoint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:406
msgid "The agent connects but an action is rejected"
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:408
msgid ""
"Check that the FCS license is still valid. The requested operation may "
"also be outside the curated public tool set or may require an open "
"session, selected video, renderer connection, or other FCS state. Ask the"
" agent to inspect the application and session status before retrying."
msgstr ""

#: ../../005_mcp.md:413
msgid "Client Documentation"
